    You... you can talk?!\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":4}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":242.000061,\"yPos\":129.601761},\"ID\":3,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"No,
    I just enjoy making dramatic noises. Of course I can talk!\",\"parentUIDs\":[2],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":5}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":500.4001,\"yPos\":222.400589},\"ID\":4,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    You're a... talking book?!\",\"parentUIDs\":[3],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":11}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":244.400024,\"yPos\":248.000809},\"ID\":5,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    And you're a walking disaster, apparently. Nice to meet you!\\n\",\"parentUIDs\":[4],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atias\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":12}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":501.2,\"yPos\":327.1997},\"ID\":11,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Hey!
    That's not very nice!\\n\\n\",\"parentUIDs\":[5],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":13}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":245.599976,\"yPos\":355.199921},\"ID\":12,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Oh,
    forgive me, Your Highness. Would you prefer \\\"lost little explorer\\\"?\",\"parentUIDs\":[11],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":14}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":500.000061,\"yPos\":424.799835},\"ID\":13,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
    not lost! I'm just... looking for my parents.\",\"parentUIDs\":[12],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":15}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":250.400085,\"yPos\":458.3998},\"ID\":14,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Right.
    In the middle of a forest. Alone. With no idea where to go. Definitely not lost.\",\"parentUIDs\":[13],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":16}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":499.200134,\"yPos\":518.399658},\"ID\":15,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"...Can
    you help me find them?\",\"parentUIDs\":[14],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":17}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":250.400085,\"yPos\":557.599854},\"ID\":16,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Hmm...
    Maybe. But first, we need to keep you alive.\",\"parentUIDs\":[15],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":18}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":250.400146,\"yPos\":657.599243},\"ID\":17,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Don't
    you see yourself? You're about to faint! You look like you haven't eaten in days.
    You need to find something to eat.\",\"parentUIDs\":[16],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":19}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":497.5999,\"yPos\":654.3992},\"ID\":18,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But...
    I don't have any food!\",\"parentUIDs\":[17],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":20}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":255.200134,\"yPos\":758.399536},\"ID\":19,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    well, Fortunately, there are plenty of edible things you can choose from in this
    forest. What about picking some mushrooms? Though they can be poisonous sometimes!\",\"parentUIDs\":[18],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":21}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":498.399963,\"yPos\":759.999634},\"ID\":20,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But
    how am I supposed to know which ones are safe?\",\"parentUIDs\":[19],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam
    \",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":22}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":252.80011,\"yPos\":854.4005},\"ID\":21,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"That's
    exactly why your dad gave me to you! Now listen closely: I'll help you spot safe
    types so you can pick carefully\u2014here are a few examples of that.\",\"parentUIDs\":[20],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas 
    \",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":23}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":254.3999,\"yPos\":943.199951},\"ID\":22,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    First, watch out for Fly Agaric (Amanita muscaria). It looks like a classic fairy-tale
    mushroom\u2014bright red cap with white spots. Pretty, right? Well, it's poisonous!
    Don't even think about taking a bite.\",\"parentUIDs\":[21],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"\u0650Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":24}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":494.4002,\"yPos\":943.199951},\"ID\":23,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Okay,
    red with white spots equals bad news. Got it!\",\"parentUIDs\":[22],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":25}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":253.6001,\"yPos\":1040.79968},\"ID\":24,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Second
    is the Jack-o'-Lantern (Omphalotus olearius). It has a bright orange color and
    grows in clusters near wood, and sometimes it even gives off a faint greenish
    glow in the dark! It's poisonous too, so step away slowly.\",\"parentUIDs\":[23],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":26}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":498.4002,\"yPos\":1040.79968},\"ID\":25,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    Glowing mushroom sounds cool... until it makes me sick. What else?\",\"parentUIDs\":[24],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":27}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":252.80011,\"yPos\":1135.99915},\"ID\":26,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Third
    is the Deadly Dapperling (Lepiota brunneoincarnata). Small, brownish-pinkish
    cap with little scales on it. Don't let its small size fool you\u2014the name
    says it all. It's deadly poisonous and very dangerous to the liver. Zero chances
    with this one!\",\"parentUIDs\":[25],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":28}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":496.800232,\"yPos\":1140.79919},\"ID\":27,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Yikes...
    okay, no touching or eating any of those three. Do you have any good news?\",\"parentUIDs\":[26],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":29}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":256.800079,\"yPos\":1232.8},\"ID\":28,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Glad
    you asked! Fourth is the Morel (Morchella esculenta). Instead of a smooth cap,
    it looks like a little sponge full of pits and ridges, usually brownish-gray.
    It's edible and super tasty\u2014just make sure it's cooked well first!\",\"parentUIDs\":[27],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":30}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":500.000183,\"yPos\":1233.6001},\"ID\":29,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    A sponge mushroom? Weird, but if it's safe and tasty, I like it!\",\"parentUIDs\":[28],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":31}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":259.2002,\"yPos\":1335.19653},\"ID\":30,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    Fifth is Shiitake (Lentinula edodes). It has a brown, umbrella-like cap with
    slightly curled edges and grows on dead or fallen trees. It's edible, full of
    flavor, and really good for you\u2014once cooked properly.\",\"parentUIDs\":[29],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":32}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":500.800232,\"yPos\":1335.99634},\"ID\":31,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    Brown cap on fallen wood, cooked well. Easy enough!\",\"parentUIDs\":[30],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":33}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":256.800079,\"yPos\":1426.39526},\"ID\":32,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"
    And sixth is the Button Mushroom (Agaricus bisporus). It's round, smooth, and
    white or light brown\u2014the classic mushroom shape most people recognize. Completely
    edible and safe, and you can even eat it raw or cooked!\",\"parentUIDs\":[31],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":34}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":502.4001,\"yPos\":1431.19531},\"ID\":33,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Finally,
    one that looks normal and doesn't try to poison me!\",\"parentUIDs\":[32],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":35}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":258.4002,\"yPos\":1521.59692},\"ID\":34,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Now,
    you know how to identify mushrooms, let's start with your first mission: Find
    some food!\",\"parentUIDs\":[33],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":36}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":501.600159,\"yPos\":1530.39746},\"ID\":35,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Okay!
    Let's do this!\",\"parentUIDs\":[34],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":true,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Adam\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0.1,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":257.600067,\"yPos\":1614.396},\"ID\":36,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"That's
    the spirit! And try not to eat anything poisonous. I'd hate to have to find another
    owner!\",\"parentUIDs\":[35],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Atlas\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0}]}"
